cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "This repository holds the artifacts behind the paper below. Please cite the paper."
title: "EML Fabric — an analog \"single operator\" computing tile"
abstract: >-
  A 2x2 Tiny Tapeout analog tile (SKY26c, sky130A) implementing a chain of two
  EML cells, each computing exp(u) - ln(v) in current mode using translinear NPN
  loops, together with the simulation code and SPICE decks behind the paper.
